{"id":1429,"title":"汉诺塔问题","summary":"Example: Tower of Hanoi","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"fb186617-54a4-330a-8272-8c4be33d9d7b","knowledge_id":56,"title":"经典汉诺塔问题","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":56,"title":"经典汉诺塔问题","knowledges":[{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"67cde2d6-bf66-3874-a0e6-638bd78b71f0","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/9612e31381d9d7a694ad.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":243,"size_in_bytes":7217,"name":"recursion-4.1.16.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"e5f0f68d-fe1f-3041-be5d-e76afd663117","title":"","title_html":"","text":"我们的目标是将所有磁盘从`Source`塔移动到`Destination`塔，条件如下：\n\n- 每次**只能移动一个**磁盘。\n- 大磁盘不能放在小磁盘上面。\n\n**tip**: 可以借助辅助`Auxiliary`搭进行磁盘转移，满足上面两个条件。\n\n> 上述问题就是经典的[**汉诺塔问题**](https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%B1%89%E8%AF%BA%E5%A1%94/3468295?fr=ge_ala)。","text_html":"<p>我们的目标是将所有磁盘从<code>Source</code>塔移动到<code>Destination</code>塔，条件如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每次<strong>只能移动一个</strong>磁盘。</li>\n<li>大磁盘不能放在小磁盘上面。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>tip</strong>: 可以借助辅助<code>Auxiliary</code>搭进行磁盘转移，满足上面两个条件。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>上述问题就是经典的<a href=\"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%B1%89%E8%AF%BA%E5%A1%94/3468295?fr=ge_ala\"><strong>汉诺塔问题</strong></a>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":1}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"bccbf61e-a1b0-35d1-8d74-3b6d5529052a","knowledge_id":57,"title":"递归思考过程","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":57,"title":"递归思考过程","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"4867f8b0-9049-31c6-855a-e0fef98d6de5","title":"","title_html":"","text":"让我们看看如何解决以下磁盘数量的汉诺塔问题：\n\n- 一个磁盘\n- 两个磁盘\n- 三个磁盘\n\n**tip**: 通过解决数量小的汉诺塔，尝试找到数量较大的问题解法。","text_html":"<p>让我们看看如何解决以下磁盘数量的汉诺塔问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一个磁盘</li>\n<li>两个磁盘</li>\n<li>三个磁盘</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>tip</strong>: 通过解决数量小的汉诺塔，尝试找到数量较大的问题解法。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f3127a34-96aa-3acb-834e-ca67bdab10e2","knowledge_id":58,"title":"一个磁盘","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":2,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":58,"title":"一个磁盘","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"95fdccdf-2a69-370b-95ab-a135a04104ff","title":"","title_html":"","text":"首先，只考虑一个磁盘。","text_html":"<p>首先，只考虑一个磁盘。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"75e41988-df42-38e8-a441-f6c17c0b91ad","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/e3dd19de02e2d68b1cfa.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":243,"size_in_bytes":6099,"name":"recursion-4.1.17.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"2c286278-db32-34eb-91a1-69091450ccb1","title":"","title_html":"","text":"只需将磁盘一从`Source`塔移至`Destination`塔即可。","text_html":"<p>只需将磁盘一从<code>Source</code>塔移至<code>Destination</code>塔即可。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"6f44a950-6cba-309f-9a2e-0599558138ed","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/f03951a5b3cf3e352722.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":243,"size_in_bytes":6150,"name":"recursion-4.1.18.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":3}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ea14809d-a40d-3fb8-9970-df3f44573c76","knowledge_id":59,"title":"两个磁盘","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":3,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":59,"title":"两个磁盘","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"29751ae8-be05-33c2-91d5-046a824554cd","title":"","title_html":"","text":"让我们看看，如果只有两个磁盘，该如何完成操作。","text_html":"<p>让我们看看，如果只有两个磁盘，该如何完成操作。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"7e15a75b-5b7c-3979-873c-234fc68518dc","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/11025be15ffd117161f6.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":243,"size_in_bytes":6731,"name":"recursion-4.1.19.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"6fb50c30-a830-31c9-b8bc-0bc0c522112b","title":"","title_html":"","text":"首先，将顶部磁盘 (**1**) 移至`Auxiliary`塔。","text_html":"<p>首先，将顶部磁盘 (<strong>1</strong>) 移至<code>Auxiliary</code>塔。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"5ef89b87-0585-3ab0-8bbd-d74f428498b8","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/bf29512d47bf4b2d42ad.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":243,"size_in_bytes":6541,"name":"recursion-4.1.20.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ae2c9859-b10f-3196-9b83-1655f4553cf7","title":"","title_html":"","text":"然后，将磁盘 (**2**) 移动到`Destination`塔。","text_html":"<p>然后，将磁盘 (<strong>2</strong>) 移动到<code>Destination</code>塔。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":4},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"838ef5f5-4319-3342-8381-3520c7373da8","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/6824d6cf883983a4aace.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":243,"size_in_bytes":6557,"name":"recursion-4.1.21.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":5},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"5f743ef6-2840-3c3c-8ab3-ff7e3aa84fc1","title":"","title_html":"","text":"最后，将磁盘 **1** 从`Auxiliary`塔移至`Destination`塔。","text_html":"<p>最后，将磁盘 <strong>1</strong> 从<code>Auxiliary</code>塔移至<code>Destination</code>塔。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":6},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"e3a8869f-6996-3469-8b5f-ce7a82e8b258","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/2a61eea9be2b9908009e.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":243,"size_in_bytes":6814,"name":"recursion-4.1.22.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":7}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"51b8f461-40b3-36a4-b42f-52f283a68b47","knowledge_id":60,"title":"三个磁盘","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":4,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":60,"title":"三个磁盘","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"db7fe69f-1b4e-3ca8-81e4-d53d82c1c786","title":"","title_html":"","text":"现在，让我们对三个磁盘进行操作。","text_html":"<p>现在，让我们对三个磁盘进行操作。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"8e01ff7d-23b6-3e7a-bcd6-c2a13d6277ef","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/aeeeaa0fe97c20b2c42e.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":243,"size_in_bytes":7386,"name":"recursion-4.1.23.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"82f42f7a-9e14-3537-b96d-d3bd59fb6314","title":"","title_html":"","text":"先把磁盘**2**和**1**移到`Auxiliary`塔上。","text_html":"<p>先把磁盘<strong>2</strong>和<strong>1</strong>移到<code>Auxiliary</code>塔上。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"38e88a51-79d4-3160-a637-cfc7105abe11","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/84fdc6edcf5c6af45a94.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":243,"size_in_bytes":7176,"name":"recursion-4.1.24.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"26a1c5d2-213b-3c22-af81-33ffc90b7ca6","title":"","title_html":"","text":"这里需要注意的是，我们并不是同时移动**1**和**2**。只是使用之前**两块磁盘**的步骤来达到的。\n\n> 即在二个磁盘时，将`Destination`搭视作`Auxiliary`搭，而`Auxiliary`搭变为目标`Destination`搭。\n\n现在，将**3**磁盘从`Source`塔移动到`Destination`塔。","text_html":"<p>这里需要注意的是，我们并不是同时移动<strong>1</strong>和<strong>2</strong>。只是使用之前<strong>两块磁盘</strong>的步骤来达到的。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>即在二个磁盘时，将<code>Destination</code>搭视作<code>Auxiliary</code>搭，而<code>Auxiliary</code>搭变为目标<code>Destination</code>搭。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>现在，将<strong>3</strong>磁盘从<code>Source</code>塔移动到<code>Destination</code>塔。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":4},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ae3daa53-caf6-3e20-b589-13d24c36ba67","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/085472b355f0665129a4.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":243,"size_in_bytes":7115,"name":"recursion-4.1.25.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":5},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"af38fa13-d669-3940-bacd-726026e4c20c","title":"","title_html":"","text":"然后用之前二个磁盘的解法，将磁盘 **1** 和 **2** 移动到`Destination`塔。","text_html":"<p>然后用之前二个磁盘的解法，将磁盘 <strong>1</strong> 和 <strong>2</strong> 移动到<code>Destination</code>塔。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":6},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b6f35b11-e7f8-3fcd-82ec-8af91c982f4c","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/70a46267a3fcde3bcd46.png","style":"original","caption":"","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":654,"height":243,"size_in_bytes":7474,"name":"recursion-4.1.26.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":7}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"fe8e7046-3010-3d63-a47b-a1423eeff351","knowledge_id":61,"title":"总结汉诺塔","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":5,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":61,"title":"总结汉诺塔","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"796fa716-1fe6-384e-a9d7-259fc9193dd3","title":"","title_html":"","text":"让我们试着总结概括一下汉诺塔。有 `n` 个磁盘。首先将 (`n - 1`) 个磁盘移动到`Auxiliary`塔。然后，将第一个磁盘从 `Source`移动到`Destination` 。\n\n最后，将 `(n-1)` 个磁盘移动到`Destination`塔。","text_html":"<p>让我们试着总结概括一下汉诺塔。有 <code>n</code> 个磁盘。首先将 (<code>n - 1</code>) 个磁盘移动到<code>Auxiliary</code>塔。然后，将第一个磁盘从 <code>Source</code>移动到<code>Destination</code> 。</p>\n<p>最后，将 <code>(n-1)</code> 个磁盘移动到<code>Destination</code>塔。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Note","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"1adaa41e-2722-39ef-b866-52449f9938b7","text":"我们编写的代码只显示完成汉诺塔的步骤。不会将磁盘从一个塔移动到另一个塔。","text_html":"<p>我们编写的代码只显示完成汉诺塔的步骤。不会将磁盘从一个塔移动到另一个塔。</p>"},"mode":"edit","step":1}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"85412380-af82-3c01-8e67-13f1aff77dab","knowledge_id":62,"title":"示例代码","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":6,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":62,"title":"示例代码","knowledges":[{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"cfaf04d8-2be8-35f1-bfc2-bbf21f84eaee","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"def towerOfHanoi(disk, source, auxiliary, destination):\n\n    # 终止条件\n    if disk == 1:\n        print('移动磁盘 1 从', source, '到', destination)\n        return \n    \n    # 将磁盘-1从source塔移动到auxiliary塔\n    towerOfHanoi(disk - 1, source, destination, auxiliary)\n    print('移动磁盘', disk , '从', source, '到', destination)\n\n    # 到达此处的终止条件，因此磁盘1将从source塔移动到destination塔\n\n    #将磁盘-1从auxiliary塔移动到destination塔\n    towerOfHanoi(disk - 1, auxiliary, source, destination)\n\ntowerOfHanoi(3, 'Source', 'Auxiliary', 'Destination')","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"bb4eaa38-f6d9-3ad0-a27d-bda400275bb0","title":"","title_html":"","text":"运行输出的步骤为:\n\n```text\n移动磁盘 1 从 Source 到 Destination\n移动磁盘 2 从 Source 到 Auxiliary\n移动磁盘 1 从 Destination 到 Auxiliary\n移动磁盘 3 从 Source 到 Destination\n移动磁盘 1 从 Auxiliary 到 Source\n移动磁盘 2 从 Auxiliary 到 Destination\n移动磁盘 1 从 Source 到 Destination\n```","text_html":"<p>运行输出的步骤为:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">移动磁盘 1 从 Source 到 Destination\n移动磁盘 2 从 Source 到 Auxiliary\n移动磁盘 1 从 Destination 到 Auxiliary\n移动磁盘 3 从 Source 到 Destination\n移动磁盘 1 从 Auxiliary 到 Source\n移动磁盘 2 从 Auxiliary 到 Destination\n移动磁盘 1 从 Source 到 Destination\n</code></pre>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"Note","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"49bcf25a-34df-3b96-b3cf-bfdc4d33e721","text":"我们强烈建议你自己调试并理解代码。这是了解递归实现原理的最佳方法。","text_html":"<p>我们强烈建议你自己调试并理解代码。这是了解递归实现原理的最佳方法。</p>"},"mode":"edit","step":2}]}}],"status":"undo","course_no":"026","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/026/page/1429"}
